{"title": "Assam invokes NSA against activist Pranab Doley after bail", "summary": "Assam authorities invoked the National Security Act (NSA) against Kaziranga activist Pranab Doley on the day he was granted bail by a court. Doley, an activist from Kaziranga, had previously been arrested. The invocation of the NSA means he will continue to be detained. The specific charges leading to his initial arrest were not detailed in the coverage.", "summary_points": ["Assam authorities invoked the National Security Act (NSA) against activist Pranab Doley.", "The NSA was invoked on the same day Doley was granted bail by a court.", "Pranab Doley is an activist from Kaziranga.", "The NSA invocation means Doley will remain in detention.", "The initial charges for Doley's arrest were not specified."], "title_hi": "असम ने जमानत मिलने के बाद कार्यकर्ता प्रणब डोले के खिलाफ NSA लागू किया", "summary_hi": "असम के अधिकारियों ने अदालत द्वारा जमानत दिए जाने के दिन काजीरंगा के कार्यकर्ता प्रणब डोले के खिलाफ राष्ट्रीय सुरक्षा अधिनियम (NSA) लागू किया। डोले, जो काजीरंगा के एक कार्यकर्ता हैं, को पहले गिरफ्तार किया गया था। NSA लागू होने का मतलब है कि वह हिरासत में रहेंगे। उनकी प्रारंभिक गिरफ्तारी के विशिष्ट आरोप कवरेज में विस्तृत नहीं थे।", "summary_points_hi": ["असम के अधिकारियों ने कार्यकर्ता प्रणब डोले के खिलाफ राष्ट्रीय सुरक्षा अधिनियम (NSA) लागू किया।", "NSA उसी दिन लागू किया गया जब डोले को अदालत ने जमानत दी थी।", "प्रणब डोले काजीरंगा के एक कार्यकर्ता हैं।", "NSA लागू होने का मतलब है कि डोले हिरासत में रहेंगे।", "डोले की गिरफ्तारी के प्रारंभिक आरोप निर्दिष्ट नहीं किए गए थे।"], "framing": {"left": ["Left-leaning coverage highlighted the invocation of the NSA against activist Pranab Doley immediately after he received bail, framing it as a denial of freedom despite judicial relief and emphasizing the continued detention of an activist."], "center": ["Centrist coverage reported the factual sequence of events, noting that Assam invoked the NSA against activist Pranab Doley on the day he was granted bail by the court."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["वाम-झुकाव वाले कवरेज ने कार्यकर्ता प्रणब डोले को जमानत मिलने के तुरंत बाद उनके खिलाफ NSA लागू करने पर प्रकाश डाला, इसे न्यायिक राहत के बावजूद स्वतंत्रता से इनकार के रूप में प्रस्तुत किया और एक कार्यकर्ता की निरंतर हिरासत पर जोर दिया।"], "center": ["मध्यमार्गी कवरेज ने घटनाओं के तथ्यात्मक क्रम की सूचना दी, जिसमें कहा गया कि असम ने अदालत द्वारा जमानत दिए जाने के दिन कार्यकर्ता प्रणब डोले के खिलाफ NSA लागू किया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/08/Pranab-Doley-Screengrab_20260731235933.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Indian Express", "owner": "Indian Express Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/india/nsa-invoked-by-assam-against-activist-pranab-doley-day-after-he-gets-bail-10812812", "headline": "NSA invoked by Assam against activist Pranab Doley day after he gets bail"}, {"source": "National Herald", "owner": "National Herald", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Assam invokes NSA against Kaziranga activist Pranab Doley after he gets bail"}, {"source": "The Pioneer", "owner": "The Pioneer", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://dailypioneer.com/news/assam--indigenous-activist-pranab-doley-held-under-nsa-a-day-after-securing-bail-in-kaziranga-case", "headline": "Bail granted , freedom denied : Assam invokes NSA against Kaziranga activist Doley"}, {"source": "National Herald", "owner": "National Herald", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Assam invokes NSA against Kaziranga activist Pranab Doley after he gets bail"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/guwahati/assam-invokes-nsa-against-activist-after-court-grants-bail/articleshow/132791824.cms", "headline": "Assam invoke